  "projectUrl": "https://alwasp.dev/",
  "published": "2026-10-18T10:56:27.34Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Unified Business Central selection under --bc-version across build, workspace build, compatibility validation, artifact commands and translation prepare. --bc-target remains a deprecated alias; combining both options now fails.\n      Compatibility validation accepts mixed version and lane lists and correctly reports non-current versions across multiple countries without fetching an unnecessary NuGet compiler.\n      Config-driven builds apply each profile's own app.json transformations and internal dependency versions. Build manifests now record effective per-profile project settings without secret values.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
